  "releaseNotes": "1.0.5 - add user lookup improvements and fix introspection audience parsing.\n\n            Changes:\n            - Add LastLogin to the user-by-id response contract\n            - Add GetUserByEmailAsync to the users client\n            - Accept aud from introspection responses as a single string or string array\n            - Validate and map all parsed audience values to aud claims",
